	(1, '01250e14-e428-469b-85d7-744ffd46a477', 96, 'new_booking', '📸 New Booking Received!', 'A new booking has been made by bogart pinatubol for Birthday Celebration - Family Package on April 29, 2026.', '"{\\"booking_id\\":2,\\"booking_reference\\":\\"BK-69D78857B4234\\",\\"client_name\\":\\"bogart pinatubol\\",\\"client_id\\":163,\\"event_date\\":\\"2026-04-29\\",\\"event_time\\":\\"09:00 - 14:00\\",\\"package_name\\":\\"Birthday Celebration - Family Package\\",\\"package_price\\":\\"22000.00\\",\\"down_payment\\":14740,\\"remaining_balance\\":7260,\\"total_amount\\":\\"22000.00\\",\\"payment_type\\":\\"downpayment\\",\\"deposit_policy\\":\\"67.00%\\",\\"location_type\\":\\"on-location\\",\\"category_id\\":\\"2\\",\\"provider_type\\":\\"studio\\",\\"provider_name\\":\\"Prism & Pine Creative Spaces\\",\\"route\\":\\"\\\\/owner\\\\/view\\\\/bookings\\",\\"city\\":\\"Dasmari\\\\u00f1as\\",\\"barangay\\":\\"Paliparan III\\",\\"street\\":\\"Street \\\\/ Building \\\\/ Unit No.\\",\\"venue_name\\":\\"Venue Name\\",\\"has_multiple_locations\\":false,\\"has_special_requests\\":true,\\"special_requests\\":\\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit. Quisque faucibus ex sapien vitae pellentesque sem placerat. In id cursus mi pretium tellus duis convallis. Tempus leo eu aenean sed diam urna tempor. Pulvinar vivamus fringilla lacus nec metus bibendum egestas. Iaculis massa nisl malesuada lacinia integer nunc posuere. Ut hendrerit semper vel class aptent taciti sociosqu. Ad litora torquent per conubia nostra inceptos himenaeos.\\"}"', 'calendar-check', 'primary', '2026-04-09 11:10:50', '2026-04-09 11:07:07', '2026-04-09 11:10:50'),
